# Build context for the documentation builder image (Dockerfile at the root).
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs only astro/, tools/, build-docs.sh and
# modules-registry.json — everything below is genuinely unused at build time
# and would otherwise be uploaded to the docker daemon for nothing.

.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

docs
hub
tests

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro

*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.DS_Store
